(6766679, 1014892, 113278, '<td valign="top">I know who did this but it doesn''t matter because I am stopped immediately on this creation. Emotional, captivating and so extremely well done. What more can I say, it is amazing, the detail, the light, the mood, it is jaw dropping. Keep putting it out here, it is a real treat to view your work. 10 and a fav.</td>', 'I know who did this but it doesn''t matter because I am stopped immediately on this creation. Emotional, captivating and so extremely well done. What more can I say, it is amazing, the detail, the light, the mood, it is jaw dropping. Keep putting it out here, it is a real treat to view your work. 10 and a fav.', '2012-05-11 09:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
