(6771880, 1014330, 97225, '<td valign="top">I loved this when I first viewed it, and still do, and yet I have found that I misread it. I ''saw'' an extra figure, on the left. It appeared to be a back view of the woman, seated, stretching forward with her arm extended back to the left. Yet this is all an illusion formed by the cloth, and her arm is in fact a leg, her shoulder, a knee. Anyway, it is in ribbon territory for me.</td>', 'I loved this when I first viewed it, and still do, and yet I have found that I misread it. I ''saw'' an extra figure, on the left. It appeared to be a back view of the woman, seated, stretching forward with her arm extended back to the left. Yet this is all an illusion formed by the cloth, and her arm is in fact a leg, her shoulder, a knee. Anyway, it is in ribbon territory for me.', '2012-05-17 21:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6771884, 1013760, 97225, '<td valign="top">Marvelously mysterious and spooky. I love the processing.</td>', 'Marvelously mysterious and spooky. I love the processing.', '2012-05-17 21:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
