(6772465, 1014888, 103142, '<td valign="top">I almost did the same type of shot! Colonial Williamsburg has a great shop like this. But when I went to CW, I really wasn''t in the mood to shoot for the challenge. I couldn''t remember where the shop was, and didn''t want to bother looking for it, so I took a few shots in a couple of places, thought maybe I had something I could use, and decided to go photograph birds instead. :)<br/> <br/>I''m so glad I didn''t look for the shop -- because your shot is truly excellent, and there''s no way I could come anywhere near this. Beautifully done -- congrats on the yellow!</td>', 'I almost did the same type of shot! Colonial Williamsburg has a great shop like this. But when I went to CW, I really wasn''t in the mood to shoot for the challenge. I couldn''t remember where the shop was, and didn''t want to bother looking for it, so I took a few shots in a couple of places, thought maybe I had something I could use, and decided to go photograph birds instead. :) I''m so glad I didn''t look for the shop -- because your shot is truly excellent, and there''s no way I could come anywhere near this. Beautifully done -- congrats on the yellow!', '2012-05-18 09:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6772467, 1014791, 103142, '<td valign="top">My top pick for the challenge -- such an incredible shot! Congrats on the HM -- I would have given it blue. :)</td>', 'My top pick for the challenge -- such an incredible shot! Congrats on the HM -- I would have given it blue. :)', '2012-05-18 09:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6772469, 1014851, 103142, '<td valign="top">I adore this!!! The cat is so incredibly well done -- the rest is fun and interesting -- but I want to spend all my time staring at the cat. :)<br/> <br/>Huge, huge congrats on an awesome photo and top 10!</td>', 'I adore this!!! The cat is so incredibly well done -- the rest is fun and interesting -- but I want to spend all my time staring at the cat. :) Huge, huge congrats on an awesome photo and top 10!', '2012-05-18 09:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
